Subject: [PATCH] Split Funnel Audit into full Overview | Metrics Table | Trend
 | Report tabs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Confirmed structure: reworks the toolbar from the 2-group layout
(seamless Trend alone + a housed Overview/List pill) into one flat row
of four seamless tabs, since all four are now peer destinations rather
than a content group plus a separate view-mode toggle:

- Overview: verdict + needs-attention + disclosures (report removed)
- Metrics Table: the same data table that was called "List" — renamed
  for clarity, content untouched
- Trend: unchanged (still only shown when history is available)
- Report (new): the Executive Audit Report, split out of Overview into
  its own destination instead of sitting at the bottom of it as a
  scroll-past continuation

Added a 4th "report" mode to the shared RunViewMode type/registry in
view-switcher.tsx — additive, doesn't affect the other 2 consumers
(win-back, pre-call-read) that don't reference it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
